{"author":"carlo.cifarelli@gmail.com","body":"Resolved by dropping the unused ticket-side reverse index. The writeup<->ticket link is stored once on the writeup (writeups:<id>:tickets); the tickets:<id>:writeups key was written/removed but never read into the Ticket model - dead writes plus a dangling-ref liability (deletes never cleaned it). Forward link is authoritative and fully covered. Added a regression assertion that no ticket-side key is written."}